  "content": "Before using the jet wash, make sure the shut-off valve is open. For 210FSH DELUXE, also ensure the anchor light socket is closed. To use: 1. Start the engines. 2. Push the jet wash switch <PIC> . Water will start after 5 seconds. You can adjust the water flow to 3 levels by pushing the switch again. 3. Use the jet wash handle lever to direct the stream. Only a passenger who is not operating the boat should use the system. The operator must attach the engine shut-off cord (lanyard) to their PFD and scan constantly. 4. To stop: push the jet wash switch, then stop the engines. Then push the collar on the hose fitting inward and disconnect the coil hose <PIC> .",
  "images": ["Manual09_176", "Manual09_175"]
}

