  "content": "The machine is equipped with an energy saving feature that automatically enters Power Off mode after 9 minutes of inactivity. To turn the machine back on, press either the Espresso or Lungo button. If you want to turn the machine off before the automatic Power Off, press both the Espresso and Lungo buttons simultaneously. <PIC> Additionally, to enter or exit the energy saving mode manually, you can press the Lungo button for 3 seconds. <PIC>",
  "images": ["Manual07_4", "Manual07_5", "Manual07_9"]
}

