  "content": "Updating the BIOS of your motherboard can be done through several methods, as outlined in the manual. The recommended approach is to use a USB flash disk with the latest BIOS file. First, insert the USB flash disk containing the update file into a USB port. Then, enter the BIOS update utility, select the USB drive, navigate to the folder containing the BIOS file, and press Enter to start the update process. Alternatively, you can use the EZ Update utility within AI Suite 3, which allows automatic or manual BIOS updates along with other motherboard software. EZ Update requires an internet connection. It is important to save a copy of your original BIOS to a USB flash disk beforehand, in case you need to restore it later. <PIC>",
  "images": ["Manual25_60"]
}

